  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><strong>What it is: </strong>A hydrating, high-shine plumping lip gloss that gives the appearance of fuller, poutier, more voluminous lips, available in a sheer and rich formula. <br><strong> </strong><strong><br>Formulation Type: </strong>Lip Gloss and Lip Plumper<br><br><strong>Benefits: </strong>Hydrating, Long-wearing, and Plumping<br><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Vitamin E: Enhances shine and adds moisture to the lips              <p>- Peppermint: Stimulates blood-flow to the lips for an instant plumping effect                            </p>- Jojoba Oil: Smooths and helps to restore hydration and moisture to the lips</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><strong>Suggested Usage:<br></strong><p>- Apply the major volume plumping gloss over your favorite shade of the precision lip crayon (sold separately) for an added pop of color.<br><br>- For the ultimate color payoff, apply the major volume plumping gloss over your favorite shade of the matte&nbsp;<br>suede lipstick (sold separately).&nbsp;</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p >Polybutene, Hydrogenated Polydecene, Diisostearyl Malate, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Hydrogenated Polyisobutene,</p><p>Tocopheryl Nicotinate, Menthyl Ethylamido Oxalate, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Helianthus Annuus</p><p>(Sunflower) Seed Oil, Persea Gratissima (Avocado) Oil, Water (Aqua, Eau), Capsicum Annuum Fruit Powder, Punica</p><p>Granatum Flower Extract, Glycine Soja (Soybean) Oil, Mentha Piperita (Peppermint) Oil, Zingiber Officinale (Ginger) Root Oil,</p><p>Cinnamomum Zeylanicum Bark Oil, Dibutyl Lauroyl Glutamide, Caprylyl Glycol, Tocopheryl Acetate, Dibutyl Ethylhexanoyl</p><p>Glutamide, 1,2-Hexanediol, Vanillyl Butyl Ether, Alcohol, Hydrogenated Styrene/Butadiene Copolymer, Hydrogenated</p><p>Styrene/Isoprene Copolymer, Isostearic Acid, Polyglyceryl-3 Diisostearate, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-di-t-butyl</p><p>Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, Hydroxymethoxyphenyl Propylmethylmethoxybenzofuran, Octyldodecanol, Ascorbyl Palmitate,</p><p>Tocopherol, Flavor (Aroma), Cinnamal, Cinnamyl Alcohol, Eugenol, Vanillin. May Contain (+/-): Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891),</p><p>Iron Oxide (CI 77491), Blue 1 Lake (CI 42090), Red 7 Lake (CI 15850), Red 28 Lake (CI 45410), Red 33 Lake (CI 17200).</p></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><strong>What it is: </strong>A hydrating, high-shine plumping lip gloss that gives the appearance of fuller, poutier, more voluminous lips, available in a sheer and rich formula. <br><strong> </strong><strong><br>Formulation Type: </strong>Lip Gloss and Lip Plumper<br><br><strong>Benefits: </strong>Hydrating, Long-wearing, and Plumping<br><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Vitamin E: Enhances shine and adds moisture to the lips              <p>- Peppermint: Stimulates blood-flow to the lips for an instant plumping effect                            </p>- Jojoba Oil: Smooths and helps to restore hydration and moisture to the lips</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><strong>Suggested Usage:<br></strong><p>- Apply the major volume plumping gloss over your favorite shade of the precision lip crayon (sold separately) for an added pop of color.<br><br>- For the ultimate color payoff, apply the major volume plumping gloss over your favorite shade of the matte&nbsp;<br>suede lipstick (sold separately).&nbsp;</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p >Polybutene, Hydrogenated Polydecene, Diisostearyl Malate, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Hydrogenated Polyisobutene,</p><p>Tocopheryl Nicotinate, Menthyl Ethylamido Oxalate, Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Helianthus Annuus</p><p>(Sunflower) Seed Oil, Persea Gratissima (Avocado) Oil, Water (Aqua, Eau), Capsicum Annuum Fruit Powder, Punica</p><p>Granatum Flower Extract, Glycine Soja (Soybean) Oil, Mentha Piperita (Peppermint) Oil, Zingiber Officinale (Ginger) Root Oil,</p><p>Cinnamomum Zeylanicum Bark Oil, Dibutyl Lauroyl Glutamide, Caprylyl Glycol, Tocopheryl Acetate, Dibutyl Ethylhexanoyl</p><p>Glutamide, 1,2-Hexanediol, Vanillyl Butyl Ether, Alcohol, Hydrogenated Styrene/Butadiene Copolymer, Hydrogenated</p><p>Styrene/Isoprene Copolymer, Isostearic Acid, Polyglyceryl-3 Diisostearate, Pentaerythrityl Tetra-di-t-butyl</p><p>Hydroxyhydrocinnamate, Hydroxymethoxyphenyl Propylmethylmethoxybenzofuran, Octyldodecanol, Ascorbyl Palmitate,</p><p>Tocopherol, Flavor (Aroma), Cinnamal, Cinnamyl Alcohol, Eugenol, Vanillin. May Contain (+/-): Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891),</p><p>Iron Oxide (CI 77491), Blue 1 Lake (CI 42090), Red 7 Lake (CI 15850), Red 28 Lake (CI 45410), Red 33 Lake (CI 17200).</p></div></details>",
